# Source PDFs are NOT redistributed from this repo.
#
# The site links to IRD's and e-Legislation's own copies instead, which are
# always current. These files stay on disk locally so the freshness workflow
# (scripts/Refresh-Data-Manifest.bat) keeps working; they are simply not
# committed. See docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-24-hktax-github-pages-design.md §3.2
Data/

# ...but our own notes about that folder are ours, and worth keeping tracked.
!Data/README.md
!Data/DIPN-CHECKLIST.md

# Local build scratch
*.tmp
~$*

# Playwright (scripts/audit-layout.js) is installed on demand, not vendored
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Python build artifacts
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Private working documents - real client/company tax papers kept locally for
# reference. These must never reach the repo: BOTH remotes are PUBLIC. An MPL
# property tax assessment was swept in by `git add -A` on 2026-10-06 and caught
# before pushing; this rule is what stops a repeat.
EXAMPLE/
